  "releaseNotes": "# v2.4.0\n### Adding an interface to identify a base \"Soft\" entity\nAdded an interface that identifies an entity as \"Soft\" so that the DAL will not actually delete the record, but set the deleted date and use that date value as the \"deleted\" flag.",
